<title>USA: Spartanburg Cty SD6, S.C., won by First Union.</title>
<headline>Spartanburg Cty SD6, S.C., won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets said it won $11.600 million of Spartanburg Cty SD 6, S.C., general obligation bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.43 percent.</p>
